{"title": "Performer", "pageid": 4944, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Performer", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Performer</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with musical instruments.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency#Instrument_proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Musical Instrument</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a>, and your <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> increases by 1, to a maximum of 20. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Performer_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Performer (Feat)\">Performer (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210934\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 451/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1479/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 723/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 645148/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.111      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   24.111      1 -total\n 18.09%    4.362      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.80%    4.050      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.60%    3.761      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 14.92%    3.598      1 Te